#                    through this post block will respect Max characters in NC comment set in CD. (Default = 80)
# CNC 07/17/13  -  Added fix for feed output with Canned Drill Cycles. (see pdrlcommonb)
# CNC 10/10/13  -  Added Productivity+ Renishaw probing support
